00:09:09.028 --> 00:09:11.836
<v Host>Quiz time. Listen and answer.

00:09:12.436 --> 00:09:18.292
<v Slow>新しい制度は、いつから始まりましたか。

00:09:19.091 --> 00:09:20.964
<v Host>From November first.

00:09:21.563 --> 00:09:29.052
<v Slow>手続きは、買った日から何日以内にしなければなりませんか。

00:09:29.851 --> 00:09:31.724
<v Host>Within ninety days.

00:09:32.323 --> 00:09:39.235
<v Slow>これまでの一日の買い物の上限は、いくらでしたか。

00:09:40.035 --> 00:09:42.148
<v Host>Five hundred thousand yen.

00:09:42.748 --> 00:09:47.403
<v Host>That's all for this evening. Thanks for listening. See you next time.

00:09:48.004 --> 00:09:50.403
<v News>また明日。
